        <mxCell id="c215" value="&lt;b&gt;①&lt;/b&gt; 시작 관문 — BUSY 100 → 쌍 108 → 값 102 → &lt;font color=&quot;#C0600A&quot;&gt;용접 중 601&lt;/font&gt; → 안전 103 → 로봇 104 → scan_id 발급 → progress.json 기록 뒤 첫 모션" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2CBD5;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=14;fontColor=#16202B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=7;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
